  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.78 - AM020 stable configuration receiver fixes\n- Missing nested-map actions preserve stable IMapperConfigurationExpression parameters, locals, and fields\n- Constructor and method block fixes emit the nested CreateMap through the original stable receiver\n- Computed, property, conditional, and indexed receivers remain fixless to avoid repeated evaluation",
